@apiUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Lấy token (dev) → đặt cookie luna_rt
# @name authUser
POST {{apiUrl}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "qa.auth@lunatech.vn", "name": "QA Auth" }

?? status == 200
?? body tokenType == Bearer
?? body user.email == qa.auth@lunatech.vn
?? header set-cookie includes luna_rt=

### /me với token vừa lấy
# @ref authUser
GET {{apiUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authUser.accessToken}}

?? status == 200
?? body email == qa.auth@lunatech.vn

### Refresh bằng cookie → token mới
# @name refreshed
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/refresh

?? status == 200
?? body accessToken exists

### Token mới dùng được
# @ref refreshed
GET {{apiUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshed.accessToken}}

?? status == 200

### Token sai chữ ký → 401
# @ref authUser
GET {{apiUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authUser.accessToken}}xyz

?? status == 401
?? body error.code == UNAUTHENTICATED

### Refresh với cookie giả → 401
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: luna_rt=not-a-real-token

?? status == 401

### Đăng xuất → 204
# @ref refreshed
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshed.accessToken}}

?? status == 204

### Sau đăng xuất token cũ hết hiệu lực → 401 SESSION_EXPIRED
# @ref refreshed
GET {{apiUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshed.accessToken}}

?? status == 401
?? body error.code == SESSION_EXPIRED
?? body error.details.reason == logout

### Sau đăng xuất không refresh được: cookie đã xoá → 204 (chưa đăng nhập, không có token)
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/refresh

?? status == 204

### Dev token từ chối email ngoài công ty → 400
POST {{apiUrl}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "someone@gmail.com" }

?? status == 400
?? body error.code == VALIDATION_ERROR

### Đăng nhập Google → 302 sang accounts.google.com
# @no-redirect
GET {{apiUrl}}/auth/google

?? status == 302
?? header location startsWith https://accounts.google.com/
?? header location includes prompt=select_account
?? header location includes code_challenge_method=S256
